      "replyToCommentDatabaseId": 3905341441,
      "path": "VAA.EAPI.Microservices/VAA.EAPI.Microservices.Loyalty.Member.Management/Application/Commands/HouseHoldAccountLinkingCommandHandler.cs",
      "line": 345,
      "url": "https://github.com/VAAD1ST/eapi/pull/1731#discussion_r3905341441",
      "author": "copilot-pull-request-reviewer",
      "body": "`TriggerEmail` is declared to return `bool` and call sites rely on a `false` return to emit a controlled HoHEmailTriggerError response, but the current catch block rethrows. Any exception will bypass the `if (!await TriggerEmail(...))` checks and fall into the outer generic exception handler, losing the specific controlled error response.",
      "decision": "valid",
      "resolutionComment": "Valid. TriggerEmail returns bool and each call site maps false to HoHEmailTriggerError, but its catch block rethrew into the outer MiscellaneousTechnicalError handler. Updated the catch block to return false and added a regression test that forces the email trigger to throw and verifies HoHEmailTriggerError is preserved."
    }
  ],
